WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.160
What does SCP-4820, the stranded,&nbsp;
regenerative Filipino man, secretly desire?

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:12.400
Foundation researchers snapped a picture of&nbsp;
SCP-4820, using SCP-978 the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:19.120
while it was sharing a meal of its own sauteed and&nbsp;
seasoned flesh with SCP-082. This was the result:

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:24.320
"The same, but a greater selection of sauces and&nbsp;
spices is present on the countertop behind it."

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.880
No matter how macabre the meal being shared,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:32.720
it's admittedly nice that SCP-4820 has&nbsp;
almost everything it wants in life.

